t; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">생 교류사업</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">인</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">FUDY(FEALAC University Discovery Year)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">를 아래와 같이 안내하오니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여&nbsp;바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: super; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">FEALAC(Forum for East Asia-Latin America Cooperation : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">동아시아</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">라틴아메리카 협력포럼</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">은 동아시아와 중남미 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">36</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">개국으로 구성된 정부간 다자협의체로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘99</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">년에 출범 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">교류사업명 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: FUDY(FEALAC University Discovery Year)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">브루나이측 참여기관 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: Universiti Brunei Darussalam</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">우리측 교육기관과 브루나이 대학간 교류사업 구체 내용</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학점인정 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">사전 합의 필요 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">브루나이 대학 지원 관련 세부내용</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">접수기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 9.15-11.15</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">교류기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2016.1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">-5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가을학기 과목 수강</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원자격 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">대학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">40</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">세 이하</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">대학원생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">40</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">세 이상 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">영어가능자 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">라</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">접수방식 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원자 소속 대학이 학생 지원서 및 관련 서류를 브루나이 대학</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(UBD Global Affairs Office)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">에 직접 전달 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">마</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원내역 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학비면제</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">항공권</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">생활비</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">의료비 등 제반경비 본인부담</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">바</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">세부사항 문의처 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">: Abby Tan(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">국제관계부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\" lang=\"EN-US\">) office.gr@ubd.edu.bn, +673-2463001</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
